# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# local backups (never publish to public repo)
# `*.bak`만 두면 `page.tsx.bak-pre-t54` 같은 접미사 백업이 안 걸려 untracked로 쌓인다.
# 실제로 50개까지 누적됐다(2026-08-03 정리). 접미사형과 보관 폴더를 함께 제외한다.
*.bak
*.bak-*
/_bak/

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.vercel
